msgstr ""
"Basahin ang ulat ng IBM sa pag-explore ng mga quantum use case para sa mga "
"airline: [\"Exploring Quantum Computing Use Cases for "
"Airlines.\"](https://www.ibm.com/thought-leadership/institute-business-"
"value/report/quantum-airlines)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read the IBM Institute for Business Value report on quantum logistics: "
